<h3 id="top-bar">Top Bar</h3>
<p>The top bar shows your tagline on the left. Set it in <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; Site Identity</b>.</p>
<p>For the <b>Classic</b> and <b>Light</b> header styles, assign a menu to the <b>Top Bar Menu</b> location in <b>Appearance &gt; Menus</b>. The <b>Transparent</b> header uses the <b>Top Bar Right</b> widget area instead; add its widgets in <b>Appearance &gt; Widgets</b>.</p>
<p>Choose the header style in <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; [PT] Theme Options &gt; Theme Layout &amp; Colors &gt; Header Style</b>. To hide the top bar, use <b>[PT] Theme Options &gt; Header &amp; Breadcrumbs &gt; Top bar visibility</b>.</p>
